<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Varian said cut to neutral.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Varian said cut to neutral.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- PaineWebber downgraded Varian Associates Inc to neutral from buy, a PaineWebber source said.</p>
<p>-- The stock lost 1-1/2 to 46.</p>
